---
title: Try dragon boating in Melbourne
layout: base.njk
description: Come paddle with the Yarra River Dragons. Beginners welcome and your first month is free.
---
{% import "icon.njk" as ic %}
<section class="hero water-hero">
  <img class="water-hero__image" src="/assets/photo-hero-4.jpg" alt="Yarra River Dragons paddling together on the water" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="container water-hero__content">
    <h1>Find your people.<br>Find your paddle.</h1>
    <p>Dragon boating on the Yarra. No experience needed, just a morning on the water and a little curiosity.</p>
    <div class="hero__ctas"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/join/">Come &amp; try for free</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#experience">See what it's like</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="water-session section">
  <div class="container water-session__inner">
    <div>{% set next = schedule.sessions[0] %}<h2>{% if schedule.source == "teamapp-build-sync" %}Next session: {{ next.day }}{% else %}Find your next session{% endif %}</h2><p>{% if schedule.source == "teamapp-build-sync" %}{{ next.time }}. {% if next.cancelled %}This session is cancelled. {% endif %}Check TeamApp for changes before travelling.{% else %}Training dates and times can change. Check TeamApp for the latest session before heading out.{% endif %} New paddlers should contact the crew for induction details.</p></div>
    <div><span class="water-accent-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><strong>Community Boating Hub</strong><p>912 Collins Street, Docklands</p><a href="{{ site.mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get directions</a></div>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/join/">Plan your first paddle</a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section water-story" id="experience">
  <div class="container water-story__grid">
    <div><h2>One boat.<br>One crew.</h2><p>You don't need to know a thing about paddling. We'll show you how. Come for the movement, the fresh air and the people beside you.</p><a class="water-link" href="/join/">Your first morning, explained</a></div>
    <figure><img src="/assets/photo-hero-2.jpg" alt="The Yarra River Dragons crew paddling together" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Real moments with the crew on the Yarra.</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section water-welcome" id="who-is-it-for">
  <div class="container water-welcome__grid"><h2>There's room for you in our boat.</h2><div><p>Everyone starts somewhere. People of all ages, abilities, genders, identities, cultures and backgrounds are welcome, including Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people.</p><p>Need an adjustment or support with costs? Reach out privately. We'll talk about what might help.</p><a class="water-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Trying%20dragon%20boating">Ask the crew anything</a></div></div>
</section>
<section class="section water-gallery">
  <div class="container"><div class="water-gallery__head"><h2>Out on the water</h2><a class="water-link" href="/gallery/">More crew moments</a></div><div class="water-gallery__photos"><img src="/assets/photo-about.jpg" alt="Yarra River Dragons members together" loading="lazy"><img src="/assets/photo-hero-4.jpg" alt="Yarra River Dragons paddling on the water" loading="lazy"></div></div>
</section>
<section class="section water-closing"><div class="container"><h2>Come see how it feels.</h2><p>Your first month is free. We'll bring the gear and show you how.</p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/join/">Come &amp; try dragon boating</a></div></section>